 """Kats adapter -- CUSUM change points in the return mean per symbol; the change points are a
 REPRESENTATION and a recent one yields a vol_transition hypothesis for the gauntlet.
+
+`bocpd_run_length` is the change-point capability that REACHES THE SIZING PATH (IDEA_QUEUE row
+119): Adams-MacKay Bayesian online change-point detection, the method Kats ships as its
+BOCPDetector, written in numpy and the standard library (math.lgamma; no scipy) so it runs
+where kats is not importable. It returns the
+run-length posterior after the last observation; `research/sizing_modifiers.bocpd_multiplier`
+reads it per sleeve on forward returns only.
 """
 from __future__ import annotations
 
+import math
